- Other keymaps (Swedish)
- Floppy: DF1-DF3, HD disks, faster writes (write-back cache), the
  drive busy-waits during a transfer (nothing else runs)
- A500/A2000 (68000, no IDE), A4000 IDE base
- Mouse, sound, the clock port RTC
- NTSC (60Hz tick)
